  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A sealed cylinder of volume <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"V\"></span> holds <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"n\"></span> molecules of an ideal gas at temperature <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"T\"></span> and density <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\rho\"></span>.</p>\n<p>What is the rms speed of the gas molecules?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{\\frac{2nRT}{\\rho V N_{A}}}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{\\frac{3nRT}{\\rho V N_{A}}}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{\\frac{2nRT}{\\rho V }}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{\\frac{3nRT}{\\rho V }}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
